              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mur’ uwo mwaka w’ icumi na kabiri nyene, ku musi ugira icumi na gatanu w’ukwezi, ijambo ry’Uhoraho rinzako, ",
