        {
          "text": "Abanyenkomezi bo mu bahizi bazovugana na bo bar’ epfo iyo i kuzimu, hamwe n’ abāhatabara; bat’ Abatākebge bāramanutse, barambaraye badakoma, bicishijwe inkota.",
